1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Built from one phone video. Running in a browser. Nothing to install.

2
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:35,000
Namma Space turns one ordinary phone video into a measured room you can walk through.

3
00:00:35,000 --> 00:01:20,000
One lens. Locked focus and exposure. Three slow passes cover walls, corners, floor and the door.

4
00:01:20,000 --> 00:02:20,000
One command writes frames, poses, scale, splats, SPZ and the walkable grid.

5
00:02:20,000 --> 00:03:30,000
WASD walks. The grid stops at walls. M opens the map. C checks a held-out photo. T runs the tour.

6
00:03:30,000 --> 00:04:00,000
Measured values sit beside their evidence. Unverified items stay marked.

7
00:04:00,000 --> 00:04:20,000
Round 1 scope is one indoor room. Place search, routes, multiple floors and WebXR AR are not built yet.
